/ActualText (This is the C4 model system architecture \(Container Diagramm\). It's modular and production-ready. The data pipeline keeps our grid data fresh. The AI core handles the heavy lifting of training. Crucially, we separate the \253Shadow Mode\273 runner - which validates decisions safely - from the actual Kubernetes Controller that binds Pods to nodes.)
