/ActualText (This is where we differ from academic prototypes. AI in production must be safe. We enforce risk management at three levels. We teach the AI to be risk-averse during training. We wrap it in a dynamic circuit breaker that shuts it down if it starts making bad decisions. And we require a mandatory shadow-mode validation period before it ever touches a real workload.)
